  "goodToKnow": "Bannen means to captivate or hold spellbound: Der Film bannte das Publikum; wie gebannt zuhören (to listen spellbound). It also means to avert or ward off: eine Gefahr bannen. Something can also be auf Film gebannt (captured on film). Historically, der Bann was excommunication: Luther was put under the Kirchenbann in 1521. To ban something is usually verbieten, and to exile someone verbannen."
